text:
This review pertains to the Sun Trust bank at 4545 N. Himes.  Of all the Sun Trust banks in Tampa I have gone to, the one on Himes is the worst. {I've never had a problem at the S. Dale Mabry or the S. MacDill locations - those two have very good service.}
.
I was at the Himes location again today, since I was in the neighborhood. There were 8 to 10 people in line the whole time, all of whom came in for simple transactions.  I waited for about 45 minutes for my turn. There was one teller for the drive-in, and one teller for inside customers. There was another employee inside the teller station, but she did not wait on anyone, and told someone she was going to lunch. There was no reason for simple transactions to take so long. This was during the noon lunch hour, normally the busiest time. The employee who went to lunch should have waited until at least 1:30, when the noon rush is over.   I have had similar experiences at the Himes location before.
